# Who is asked to review a change. The rules below are the last match wins, as in .gitignore; every pattern must match a
# file that exists (internal/repocheck fails on a stale one after a rename). The ruleset does not require a code owner's
# approval: the owner is the only maintainer and cannot approve their own pull request, so this asks for a review and
# blocks nothing.
